      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "=Note for others how to fix even VCC not open isssue=\n\nTry going here `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\VRChatCreatorCompanion` and renaming `settings.json` to `settings-old.json` or delete.\n\nAlso rename `vcc.liteDb` to `vccOld.liteDb`.\n\nYou can try to open settingsOld you just made and copy the projects part and userRepos into the new settings file if you dont want to re-add them again.",
