  "details": "Theres really not much for me to say, i dont have a clue what the issue is, ive seen a few others say they had it happen aswell so im fairly certain im not alone.\n\ni pressed update in the vcc to update to 2.2.0, it updated and when i next tried opening it, it wouldnt start anymore, doesnt show in task manager, doesnt show in the taskbar, nothing. restarted my computer twice, reinstalled twice, including installing 2.2.1 and 2.2.2, still the same problem, the only antivirus i use is windows defender, and it isnt flagging it at all, and of course ive tried with it off, still doesnt fix it.\n\nlog doesnt have anything to really say, its just one line. \n\n2023-12-10 21:09:48.903 -06:00 [INF] VRCLibLogger Writing logs to C:\\Users\\aidan\\AppData\\Local\\VRChatCreatorCompanion\\Logs\\20231210T210948-63a590b0d8604fc69c6e0eb7d1727b83-log.txt",
